  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENGIE Energy Access feasibility studies for solar mesh grid Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norad supports EEA Nigeria with market studies, technical studies, commercial analysis and ESG assessments for establishing solar mesh grids in 40 villages in Nigeria. The mesh grids - larger constellations of interconnected solar home systems, will increase flexibility and stability of energy access to low-income households. The project seeks to provide access to 40 000 people with this initial investment, and use the experience as a model for scaling the solution to other villages in Nigeria and beyond.</narrative>
  </description>
